  "Scope": "NB preparation admits one existing input-work unit before each bounded group of at most64 epsilon cells per row, instead of charging every simple cell. Scalar passes and atom-specific charges remain; direct original-token/deadline checks before every quantum and publication avoid poll-interval multiplication. Exact viable tables/storage/loans match; preparation work units intentionally decrease and are documented. No unlimited exemption, new field/helper/framework/mode/API or unchecked access. Eleven equal-result public Count cases: canonical LF region46429bytes/SHA507F5A33C406D155D02A9633551C5231E9CF9890D250C1A5153045F224C688D2, ordinary/compiled/live/finite-live/deadline-live; Unicode/wide/nullable NB graphs and unchanged non-NB scalar/literal controls. Full strict validation/publication included; setup/compilation excluded. Warm1.5s/min64calls, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples each\u003E=20ms; batches checked after timing. One120s cap, at most one selected noise confirmation. No package/fullcatalog or unchecked-access campaign.",
